---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import '../styles/pages/portfolio-pages.css';
---
<BaseLayout nav="portfolio" logic="base">
<!-- ============ PROJECT HERO (ProjectHero) ============ -->
<section style="background: #F1F4E6; overflow: hidden">
<div style="max-width: 1240px; margin: 0 auto; padding: clamp(40px, 6vw, 72px) clamp(16px, 4vw, 32px) clamp(56px, 7vw, 88px); display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(min(460px, 100%), 1fr)); gap: clamp(40px, 5vw, 72px); align-items: center">
<div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 22px; align-items: flex-start">
<nav aria-label="Breadcrumb" style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; color: #5E6B3E"><a href="/" style="color: #5E6B3E">Home</a><span aria-hidden="true">/</span><a href="/web-design-portfolio/" style="color: #5E6B3E">Portfolio</a><span aria-hidden="true">/</span><a href="/e-commerce-websites/" style="color: #5E6B3E">E-commerce Websites</a><span aria-hidden="true">/</span><span style="color: var(--ink)">Kulaman Ranch</span></nav>
<span style="font-size: 12px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: 0.08em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #4B5E1F; background: #fff; border-radius: 999px; padding: 5px 14px">Project · E-commerce · Dairy</span>
<h1 style="font-size: clamp(40px, 4.8vw, 62px); line-height: 1.05; letter-spacing: -0.03em; font-weight: 800; color: var(--ink); text-wrap: balance">Kulaman Ranch</h1>
<p style="font-size: clamp(18px, 1.6vw, 21px); color: var(--ink); opacity: 0.85; max-width: 520px">Growing success through digital innovation.</p>
<dl style="margin: 6px 0 0; display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(min(180px, 100%), 1fr)); gap: 16px 28px; width: 100%; font-size: 15px"><div><dt style="color: #5E6B3E; font-weight: 600">Industry</dt><dd style="margin: 0; color: var(--ink); font-weight: 700">Dairy Farm &amp; Products</dd></div><div><dt style="color: #5E6B3E; font-weight: 600">Services</dt><dd style="margin: 0; color: var(--ink); font-weight: 700">E-commerce store, farm tour booking, SEO</dd></div><div><dt style="color: #5E6B3E; font-weight: 600">Website</dt><dd style="margin: 0; color: var(--ink); font-weight: 700"><a href="https://kulaman.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="color: #4B5E1F">kulaman.com ↗</a></dd></div></dl>
</div>
<div style="position: relative; min-height: 420px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center">
<div style="width: 92%; background: #1A2036; border-radius: 18px 18px 6px 6px; padding: 11px 11px 15px; box-shadow: 0 40px 70px -30px rgba(13,24,56,0.45)">
<img src="/images/kul-desk.webp" alt="Kulaman Ranch website homepage" style="display: block; width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 6px" decoding="async">
</div>
<div style="position: absolute; right: 0; bottom: -4%; width: 34%; background: #fff; border-radius: 22px; padding: 6px; box-shadow: 0 30px 50px -20px rgba(13,24,56,0.45)"><img src="/images/kul-photo.webp" alt="" style="display: block; width: 100%; aspect-ratio: 1 / 1; object-fit: cover; border-radius: 16px" decoding="async"></div>
</div>
</div>
</section>

<!-- ============ RESULTS (ResultStats) ============ -->
<section style="background: #fff; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line)">
<div style="max-width: 1240px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 48px clamp(16px, 4vw, 32px); display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(min(260px, 100%), 1fr)); gap: 16px"><div style="background: var(--tint2); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 24px; padding: 28px"><p style="font-size: 44px; line-height: 1; font-weight: 800; color: var(--blue); letter-spacing: -0.03em">50%</p><p style="margin-top: 10px; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--ink)">Farm tour bookings</p></div><div style="background: var(--tint2); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 24px; padding: 28px"><p style="font-size: 44px; line-height: 1; font-weight: 800; color: var(--blue); letter-spacing: -0.03em">40%</p><p style="margin-top: 10px; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--ink)">Dairy product sales</p></div></div>
</section>

<!-- ============ STORY (ProjectStory) ============ -->
<section style="background: #fff">
<div style="max-width: 1240px; margin: 0 auto; padding: clamp(64px, 8vw, 96px) clamp(16px, 4vw, 32px); display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 24px">
<div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(min(360px, 100%), 1fr)); gap: 24px">
<article style="border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 28px; padding: clamp(28px, 3.5vw, 44px); display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px"><p class="eb">The challenge</p><p>Kulaman Ranch aimed to promote its organic dairy products, attract more farm visitors and establish itself as a leader in sustainable farming. It needed a website that showcased its commitment to organic dairy while giving customers an easy way to order products and book farm tours.</p></article>
<article style="background: var(--navy); border-radius: 28px; padding: clamp(28px, 3.5vw, 44px); display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px"><p class="eb" style="color: #8BE9F0">What we built</p><p style="color: #C9D3F2">We designed a rustic, nature-inspired e-commerce website with an online store for dairy products, an interactive farm tour booking system and educational content about sustainable dairy farming. Our SEO strategies increased visibility with local customers and tourists.</p></article>
</div>
<article style="background: var(--tint2); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 28px; padding: clamp(28px, 3.5vw, 44px); display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 16px"><p class="eb">The impact</p><ul style="list-style: none; margin: 0; padding: 0; display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(min(300px, 100%), 1fr)); gap: 14px 32px; font-size: 16px; color: var(--ink); font-weight: 500"><li class="chk"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#3D66E4" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" style="flex: none; margin-top: 3px"><path d="m5 12 5 5L20 7"></path></svg>Higher customer engagement, with more inquiries about sustainable farming</li><li class="chk"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#3D66E4" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" style="flex: none; margin-top: 3px"><path d="m5 12 5 5L20 7"></path></svg>Improved brand presence, making Kulaman Ranch a recognised name in organic dairy</li></ul></article>
</div>
</section>

<!-- ============ SCREENS (ScreenGallery) ============ -->
<section style="background: #F1F4E6">
<div style="max-width: 1240px; margin: 0 auto; padding: clamp(64px, 8vw, 96px) clamp(16px, 4vw, 32px); display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 28px">
<h2 style="font-size: clamp(26px, 2.6vw, 34px); line-height: 1.2; letter-spacing: -0.02em; font-weight: 800; color: var(--ink)">Inside the website</h2>
<div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(min(320px, 100%), 1fr)); gap: 24px"><figure style="margin: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px"><img src="/images/kul-desk.webp" alt="Kulaman Ranch Homepage" style="display: block; width: 100%; aspect-ratio: 16 / 10; object-fit: contain; object-position: center; padding: 14px; box-sizing: border-box; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 24px; background: #fff" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><figcaption style="font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--ink)">Homepage</figcaption></figure><figure style="margin: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px"><img src="/images/kul-photo.webp" alt="Kulaman Ranch On the ranch" style="display: block; width: 100%; aspect-ratio: 1 / 1; object-fit: cover; object-position: center; border-radius: 24px; background: #fff" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><figcaption style="font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--ink)">On the ranch</figcaption></figure></div>
</div>
</section>

<!-- ============ MORE PROJECTS ============ -->
<section style="background: #fff">
<div style="max-width: 1240px; margin: 0 auto; padding: clamp(64px, 8vw, 96px) clamp(16px, 4vw, 32px) 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 32px">
<div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-end; gap: 16px"><h2 style="font-size: clamp(28px, 2.8vw, 38px); line-height: 1.2; letter-spacing: -0.02em; font-weight: 800; color: var(--ink)">More e-commerce websites</h2><a class="btn btn-ghost" href="/e-commerce-websites/">See all</a></div>
<div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(min(320px, 100%), 1fr)); gap: 24px"><a class="card" href="/skincare-website-design-lana/" style="background: #fff; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 28px; overflow: hidden; display: flex; flex-direction: column; color: inherit"><img src="/images/lana-photo.webp" alt="Lana Naturalis" style="display: block; width: 100%; aspect-ratio: 1 / 1; object-fit: cover; background: #EDF1EA" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><div style="padding: 22px 26px 26px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px"><span style="font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--muted)">E-commerce · Skincare</span><h3 style="font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--ink)">Lana Naturalis</h3></div></a><a class="card" href="/pasalubong-e-commerce-website-mangkikos-cacao/" style="background: #fff; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 28px; overflow: hidden; display: flex; flex-direction: column; color: inherit"><img src="/images/mk-photo.webp" alt="Mang Kiko&#x27;s Cacao" style="display: block; width: 100%; aspect-ratio: 1 / 1; object-fit: cover; background: #F1E7E0" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><div style="padding: 22px 26px 26px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px"><span style="font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--muted)">E-commerce · Pasalubong</span><h3 style="font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--ink)">Mang Kiko's Cacao</h3></div></a></div>
</div>
</section>

<!-- ============ CTA BAND (CtaBand) ============ -->
<section style="background: #fff; padding: clamp(72px, 9vw, 112px) clamp(16px, 4vw, 32px)">
<div style="max-width: 1240px; margin: 0 auto; background: var(--navy); border-radius: 36px; padding: clamp(48px, 7vw, 88px) clamp(24px, 6vw, 80px); position: relative; overflow: hidden; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 32px">
<div aria-hidden="true" style="position: absolute; width: 420px; height: 420px; border-radius: 50%; background: #1E42B1; right: -120px; top: -180px; opacity: 0.7"></div>
<div aria-hidden="true" style="position: absolute; width: 120px; height: 120px; border-radius: 50%; background: #00C5D3; right: 22%; bottom: -60px; opacity: 0.35"></div>
<div style="position: relative; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 16px; max-width: 620px"><h2 style="font-size: clamp(32px, 3.6vw, 50px); line-height: 1.1; letter-spacing: -0.03em; font-weight: 800; color: #fff">Want a website like this?</h2><p style="color: #C9D3F2; font-size: 18px">Book a free Clinic Growth Audit and we'll show you what a better website could do for your business.</p></div>
<div style="position: relative; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 14px"><a class="btn btn-cta" href="/contact-website-development-services/">Book a Free Clinic Growth Audit</a><a class="btn btn-light" href="/web-design-portfolio/">View Our Work</a></div>
</div>
</section>
</BaseLayout>
